n\nso we want to move to the point $(0.2,0.1).$\n\nMoving from $(0,0)$ to $(0.2,0.1),$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Δx & =0.2-0=0.2, \\\\ Δy & =0.1-0=0.1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Δf & ≈\\frac{1}{2}(0.2)+\\frac{1}{2}(0.1) \\\\  & =0.1+0.05 \\\\  & =0.15.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis means that the value of $f$ increases by about $0.15.$ Consequently, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(0.2,0.1) & ≈f(0,0)+0.15 \\\\ \\sqrt{{e}^{0.2}+0.1} & ≈\\sqrt{{e}^{0}+0}+0.15 \\\\  & =1+0.15 \\\\  & =1.15.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535223 true] [17592186338413 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338414 13194139535223 true] [17592186338413 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338415 13194139535223 true] [17592186338413 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338416 13194139535223 true] [17592186338413 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338417 13194139535223 true] [17592186338413 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338418 13194139535223 true] [17592186338413 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535223 true] [17592186338413 1041 "selection" 13194139535223 true] [17592186338413 1104 #edb/ref 17592186338414 13194139535223 true] [17592186338413 1110 #uuid "0c7f1e05-fc03-519c-9816-58a27106844d" 13194139535223 true] [17592186338414 1034 "1.15" 13194139535223 true] [17592186338414 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535223 true] [17592186338414 1111 #uuid "d359091b-d471-567a-83c2-07c7d3c45991" 13194139535223 true] [17592186338415 1034 "1.18" 13194139535223 true] [17592186338415 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535223 true] [17592186338415 1111 #uuid "c03f28f0-525d-5df5-9356-5befa19004c9" 13194139535223 true] [17592186338416 1034 "0.25" 13194139535223 true] [17592186338416 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535223 true] [17592186338416 1111 #uuid "5149d8f4-b99e-5867-88cd-a23d8632b5f5" 13194139535223 true] [17592186338417 1034 "0.15" 13194139535223 true] [17592186338417 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535223 true] [17592186338417 1111 #uuid "06a01ca9-3dc0-55f9-8a85-7a220c7c8be5" 13194139535223 true] [17592186338418 1034 "1.2